>A</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">S1</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">A</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">A-S</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">15</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Punishing&#x02013;cruel</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">M</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">A</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">C1</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">C3</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">A</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">S1</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">A</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">A-S</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>M indicates SF-MPQ; S, sensory; A, affective; Cassissi A, African American sample; Cassisi B, European American sample; C1, Cassisi factor 1; C2, Cassisi factor 2; C3, Cassisi factor 3; C4, Cassisi factor 4; S1, shin factor 1; S2, shin factor 2; S-A, sensory acute; S-C, sensory chronic; X, not used; and A-S, affective sensory.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>SF-MPQ item and total severity score means and standard deviations</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">SF-MPQ item</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Item means (SD)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Skew</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Kurtosis</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Throbbing</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.36 (1.08)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.04</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;1.31</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Shooting</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.01 (1.08)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.55</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;1.10</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Stabbing</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.74 (1.01)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.02</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.33</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Sharp</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.36 (1.13)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.11</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;1.39</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cramping</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.67 (0.93)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.15</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.14</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Gnawing</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.80 (1.08)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.93</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.65</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Hot burning</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.33 (1.19)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.18</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;1.46</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Aching</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.50 (1.07)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.10</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;1.24</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Heavy</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.82 (1.10)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.96</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.57</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Tender</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.99 (1.03)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.59</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.82</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Splitting</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.61 (1.00)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.33</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.31</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Tiring-exhausting</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.18 (1.12)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.35</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;1.29</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Sickening</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.62 (0.98)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.39</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.62</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Fearful</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.61 (1.00)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.39</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.49</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Punishing&#x02013;cruel</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.56 (1.02)</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.56</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.89</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Visual Analog Scale</td><td row